commit: 301e9031
decisions:
  - id: pipe-ownership
    decision: The kernel binds the pipe; the helper tightens its DACL through a WRITE_DAC client handle; nothing is served before the owner-only read-back with serverPid === kernel
    rationale: 'P03: Node cannot adopt a foreign pipe on Windows; the DACL is pipe-wide; libuv FIRST_PIPE_INSTANCE makes a squat fail closed'
  - id: verified-root
    decision: On win32 a path inside a verified owner-only home inherits owner-only; key material is always read back per file and nlink>1 is refused
    rationale: Avoids a helper round trip per file while keeping key custody on a read-back (Aegis M3)
  - id: w5-sandbox-shape
    decision: Windows session sandbox = restricted token (user groups + user + GNOMON_SESSION_SID) with session-SID deny ACEs for reads, Low integrity with Low-labelled writable roots for writes and process isolation, private Low desktop, job UI limits
    rationale: Restricted token alone lets a session inject into the user's Medium processes; Low IL blocks VM/thread/dup access and UIPI input while the deny ACEs carry the read deny list; founder asked for the proper sandbox, not an interim
errors_encountered:
  - description: Lockfile from the Mac lacks win32 native optional deps (rollup/rolldown/lightningcss)
    resolution: Same no-save install as .github/actions/install-deps
  - description: Double free in sd_from_sddl (struct update copied a raw pointer from a Drop type) crashed the helper with 0xC0000374
    resolution: Single owner of the SD
  - description: REVOKE_ACCESS does not remove deny ACEs
    resolution: Walk the ACL and drop explicit session-SID ACEs by hand
  - description: Low IL child failed DLL init (0xC0000142) on a Medium-labelled private desktop
    resolution: Label the desktop Low
  - description: 'A probe reported an injection ''escape'' that was a false positive: Add-Type cannot compile at Low IL (TEMP not writable) so the test type never existed'
    resolution: 'Point TEMP at a Low-labelled dir; real result: VM/thread/dup access denied'
learnings:
  - libuv binds a Windows pipe's first instance exclusively; the default pipe DACL grants Everyone/Anonymous FILE_READ
  - A restricted token with the user SID among restricting SIDs can still open the user's Medium processes; Low integrity is what stops injection
  - The owner's implicit WRITE_DAC defeats deny ACEs inside a session unless an OWNER RIGHTS ACE is present
  - Vitest cannot import a CRLF-shebang .mjs; pin *.mjs eol=lf
  - icacls cannot name an unmapped SID like S-1-9-…; use the .NET or Win32 ACL APIs
verification:
  status: partial
  details:
    kernel: 1977 pass; 13 machine-only (Developer Mode symlinks, Node 24.13 SQLite warning)
    helper: cargo test 7 pass; win32-helper.test.ts 8 pass
    manual: dev init + dev up on Windows; pipe DACL D:P(A;;FA;;;<user>)
